From 1b080d4202cda0ae6cc6bec3d318b37830c0ed40 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Quintin Smits <qd.smits@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 18:32:44 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] test(app): a project saved with each old Agie post name
 posts the goldens

The #4022 review found that the legacy-project test only read the
script text. The new agie_native::legacy_name test opens the
control-checked punch saved under each old name, posts it with no
per-run option override, compares the ISO, SBR and SBL files with the
unchanged goldens, and checks that a save writes the new name. The
wire_post_alias round-trip keeps the open and save checks, under a name
that no longer says it posts.

Refs #4000

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
